           If it finds that you have models available for the aircraft
           types in the mission, it asks you which particular flight model
           you wish to use for that plane type.

           This might sound a bit complicated, but it is actually
           automatic!  One note:  if you have "Enemy Views Lockout"
           checked in the StratFalc config, StratFalc will *not* prompt
           you for enemy plane flight models, even if they're present; to
           do so would be the same as telling you what your opposition is.


